# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository so that editors on any
# platform stop producing whole-file diffs when only EOLs change
# (see review notes on PR #4).
* text=auto

# Explicit binary guards. ROM/BIOS/save assets are out-of-tree by policy,
# but keep them out of text normalization if ever present locally.
*.gba binary
*.gb binary
*.gbc binary
*.bin binary
*.bios binary
*.sav binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
